{"4297460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fairwind", "steam_appid": 4297460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5091940], "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297460/extras/58038a8ef6ce8834f42a7c507ba79a44.avif?t=1787939743\" width=1000 height=682 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO FAIRWIND!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail for an immersive nautical journey that blends ocean exploration with deep sailing mechanics. Command your vessel, navigate dynamic weather, and run a profitable trade route across a living archipelago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAILING MECHANICS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced but accessible sailing that rewards forward thinking and operating multiple stations to sail your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the wind, adjust your angles, and tack cleanly across open water to successfully reach your destination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reef your sails to keep from capsizing when bad weather rolls in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVER CHANGING OCEAN </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open world filled islands scattered across distinct biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voyage through shifting weather, dramatically changing waves, and a full day/night cycle that makes every trip feel unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anchor in vibrant towns and quiet villages, each with their own needs and regional products.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CARGO &amp; ECONOMY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tetromino shaped cargo means preparing for each voyage is a satisfying puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goods that degrade and lose value over time if poorly stored or exposed to harsh conditions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supply and Demand economy system that changes on the needs of the settlement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHIPS &amp; MAINTENANCE </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four distinct vessels from nimble sloops to massive galleons, each with their own characteristics and sail plan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace worn sails, repair leaky hulls and purchase specialized ship upgrades at harbour masters around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your vessel shipshape by bailing water and patching hulls or risk sinking.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OPTIONAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit up to three friends to help you sail and haul cargo, or simply enjoy peaceful solitude in solo play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO FAIRWIND!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail for an immersive nautical journey that blends ocean exploration with deep sailing mechanics. Command your vessel, navigate dynamic weather, and run a profitable trade route across a living archipelago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAILING MECHANICS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced but accessible sailing that rewards forward thinking and operating multiple stations to sail your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the wind, adjust your angles, and tack cleanly across open water to successfully reach your destination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reef your sails to keep from capsizing when bad weather rolls in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVER CHANGING OCEAN </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open world filled islands scattered across distinct biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voyage through shifting weather, dramatically changing waves, and a full day/night cycle that makes every trip feel unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anchor in vibrant towns and quiet villages, each with their own needs and regional products.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CARGO &amp; ECONOMY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tetromino shaped cargo means preparing for each voyage is a satisfying puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goods that degrade and lose value over time if poorly stored or exposed to harsh conditions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supply and Demand economy system that changes on the needs of the settlement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHIPS &amp; MAINTENANCE </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four distinct vessels from nimble sloops to massive galleons, each with their own characteristics and sail plan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace worn sails, repair leaky hulls and purchase specialized ship upgrades at harbour masters around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your vessel shipshape by bailing water and patching hulls or risk sinking.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OPTIONAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit up to three friends to help you sail and haul cargo, or simply enjoy peaceful solitude in solo play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "FAIRWIND is a relaxing open-world sailing game about delivering cargo to 